{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What happened to Kamilia?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/4b992538cac0007f2db4c0253a73342f.avif?t=1770727300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras_big/4b992538cac0007f2db4c0253a73342f.webp?t=1770727300 width=1560 height=690 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kamilia is a unique detective mystery, that follows the story of a talented painter, as he finds himself involved in an ongoing murder investigation that was left unsolved for years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1909, a dramatic event shook the entire town of Roga and started a chain of events<br>that led to an unsolvable crime. <br>8 years later, it is up to you to learn the truth, and clear the unsettling shadows of death that took over Roga. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/59b08b50beff386db0b9f7da3c07791b.avif?t=1770727300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras_big/59b08b50beff386db0b9f7da3c07791b.webp?t=1770727300 width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will play as multiple characters, and make important choices that will shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an intense and emotional story, as the painter struggles to unveil the town's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/7d6c536ca72c65d8ad34f498a0136044.avif?t=1770727300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras_big/7d6c536ca72c65d8ad34f498a0136044.webp?t=1770727300 width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story-rich visual novel, with moderate puzzle elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, based on the choices you make.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and complex characters for you to meet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cherry-picked soundtrack, including an original song - 'Lilies'</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654030?t=1770727300","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770727300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/8a2251f5baeefa6fd2cc9775ae7fbcfb732aaa81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770727300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/8a2251f5baeefa6fd2cc9775ae7fbcfb732aaa81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770727300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id"